<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Maxscript May Bundle on Jesses Tech Art Folio</title><link>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/</link><description>Recent content in Maxscript May Bundle on Jesses Tech Art Folio</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Batch Mesh Renamer</title><link>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/tool-batch-asset-renamer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/tool-batch-asset-renamer/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/tool-batch-asset-renamer/asset_renamer.webp"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="maxscript thumbnail" style="width: 400px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;"&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle"&#10; class="blog-button"&#10; &gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;svg class="blog-icon"&#10; viewBox="0 0 24 24"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor"&#10; d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v16c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm1 7V4.5L18.5 9H15zM8 13h8v2H8v-2zm0 4h8v2H8v-2z"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; Return to Maxscript 2025 Megapost&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/d0ggowo/junkyard"&#10; class="github-button"&#10; style="color: #26d83e;"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; Grab the tool here&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="the-problem-and-what-it-solves"&gt;The Problem and What It Solves&lt;/h1&gt; &#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Ever had to rename your LODS, add prefixes or suffixes for baking or fix exports for Unreal Engine? Download the script from my repo, then simply select the meshes you want to rename, apply or remove the chosen prefix/suffix to the meshes. You can fully edit the text for prefix and suffix to fit your project needs and naming conventions. ​&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mesh Aligner</title><link>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/mesh-aligner/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/mesh-aligner/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/mesh-aligner/mesh-align-thumb.png"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="maxscript thumbnail" style="width: 400px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;"&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle"&#10; class="blog-button"&#10; &gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;svg class="blog-icon"&#10; viewBox="0 0 24 24"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor"&#10; d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v16c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm1 7V4.5L18.5 9H15zM8 13h8v2H8v-2zm0 4h8v2H8v-2z"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; Return to Maxscript 2025 Megapost&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/d0ggowo/junkyard"&#10; class="github-button"&#10; style="color: #26d83e;"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; Grab the tool here&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="the-problem-and-what-it-solves"&gt;The Problem and What It Solves&lt;/h1&gt; &#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Unsure of how to find ngons, stray vertices and other face issues prior to export? Simply drag and drop this script in and use the check icons to scan meshes. It supports checking for ngons, floating vertices and overlapping vertices, all issues that could cause mesh problems later on. Using the select icon, you can preview problem areas on the mesh.&#10;&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ODWO7nlozm8?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mesh Pivot Setter</title><link>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/pivot-setter/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/pivot-setter/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/pivot-setter/pivot-thumb.png"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="maxscript thumbnail" style="width: 400px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;"&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle"&#10; class="blog-button"&#10; &gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;svg class="blog-icon"&#10; viewBox="0 0 24 24"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor"&#10; d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v16c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm1 7V4.5L18.5 9H15zM8 13h8v2H8v-2zm0 4h8v2H8v-2z"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; Return to Maxscript 2025 Megapost&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/d0ggowo/junkyard"&#10; class="github-button"&#10; style="color: #26d83e;"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; Grab the tool here&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="the-problem-and-what-it-solves"&gt;The Problem and What It Solves&lt;/h1&gt; &#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Stuck setting the pivots on your meshes for modular meshes, bulk or simply want to reset all to ground using each meshes complex shape? Drag and drop this script in for an easy way to set pivots in 3DSMax. This tool supports setting pivots using mesh bounds, transferring pivots from A to B or setting them using global scene coordinates.&#10;&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/P73T2g7IHqE?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mesh Validator</title><link>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/mesh-validator/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/mesh-validator/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/mesh-validator/mesh_checker_tool_thumbnail.png"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="maxscript thumbnail" style="width: 400px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;"&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle"&#10; class="blog-button"&#10; &gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;svg class="blog-icon"&#10; viewBox="0 0 24 24"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor"&#10; d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v16c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm1 7V4.5L18.5 9H15zM8 13h8v2H8v-2zm0 4h8v2H8v-2z"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; Return to Maxscript 2025 Megapost&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/d0ggowo/junkyard"&#10; class="github-button"&#10; style="color: #26d83e;"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; Grab the tool here&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="the-problem-and-what-it-solves"&gt;The Problem and What It Solves&lt;/h1&gt; &#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Unsure of how to find ngons, stray vertices and other face issues prior to export? Simply drag and drop this script in and use the check icons to scan meshes. It supports checking for ngons, floating vertices and overlapping vertices, all issues that could cause mesh problems later on. Using the select icon, you can preview problem areas on the mesh.&#10;&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/6AxDDWs1fPc?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tree Generator</title><link>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/tree-generator/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/tree-generator/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle/tree-generator/thumb2_edited.png"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="maxscript thumbnail" style="width: 400px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;"&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://debug-blog.jolchawa.site/projects/maxscript-bundle"&#10; class="blog-button"&#10; &gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;svg class="blog-icon"&#10; viewBox="0 0 24 24"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor"&#10; d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v16c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm1 7V4.5L18.5 9H15zM8 13h8v2H8v-2zm0 4h8v2H8v-2z"/&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; Return to Maxscript 2025 Megapost&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/d0ggowo/junkyard"&#10; class="github-button"&#10; style="color: #26d83e;"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; Grab the tool here&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="the-problem-and-what-it-solves"&gt;The Problem and What It Solves&lt;/h1&gt; &#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This was a fun challenge to end off Maxscript May 2025 to create an all in one tree builder using just Maxscript. The final results are in Unreal Engine with a custom leaf and trunk shader. In future terms its not quick to run and kind of cumbersome I would definitely redo this in another software like Houdini.&#10;&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lEQ-ne_A6d0?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>